{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>במשמרותם.</b> [This refers] to the elders. And the section of Passover is attached, because the dedication was in the first month, and then the Levites were separated. And this section comes because it is written with Passover, both 'When you come to the land' and 'When YHWH brings you' — He commanded that they are obligated even in the wilderness."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {0 "The lemma במשמרותם is from Numbers 8:26; Ibn Ezra appears to be addressing the placement/order of the surrounding Torah sections rather than the word itself directly."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:55.281925833Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}